1
00:00:01,320 --> 00:00:07,500
1. Using language. Reading and speaking. English jokes.

2
00:00:08,580 --> 00:00:14,900
1. What's that fly doing in my soup?

3
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:17,960
Swimming, I think.

4
00:00:19,420 --> 00:00:22,300
2. What's that?

5
00:00:23,160 --> 00:00:24,400
It's bean soup.

6
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:29,460
I don't want to know what it's bean. I want to know what it is now.

7
00:00:31,640 --> 00:00:36,520
3. Waiter, will the pancakes be long?

8
00:00:37,740 --> 00:00:39,820
No, sir. Round.

9
00:00:41,520 --> 00:00:48,940
2. Sherlock Holmes and Dr Watson went camping in a mountainous area.

10
00:00:49,940 --> 00:00:52,460
They were lying in the open air under the stars.

11
00:00:53,520 --> 00:00:55,300
Sherlock Holmes looked up at the stars

12
00:00:55,300 --> 00:00:56,060
and whispered,

13
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:01,160
Watson, when you look at that beautiful sky,

14
00:01:01,820 --> 00:01:03,460
what do you think of?

15
00:01:04,660 --> 00:01:05,840
Watson replied,

16
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:12,100
I think of how short life is and how long the universe has lasted.

17
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:17,100
No, no, Watson, Holmes said.

18
00:01:18,200 --> 00:01:20,260
What do you really think of?

19
00:01:20,780 --> 00:01:22,220
Watson tried again.

20
00:01:23,040 --> 00:01:28,220
I think of how small I am and how vast the sky is.

21
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:36,720
Try again, Watson, said Holmes. Watson tried a third time.

22
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:43,320
I think of how cold the universe is and how warm people can be in their beds,

23
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:45,540
Holmes said.

24
00:01:46,640 --> 00:01:51,880
Watson, you fool, you should be thinking that someone has stolen our tent.

25
00:01:52,220 --> 00:01:52,840
Thank you.
